Bear in mind, this function will not work correctly with negative weights, it assumes weights are non-negative. If the graph contains cycles, the function may enter an infinite loop in case of BFS: depth-first search should be used in that case. For the case where there are cycles, you could modify the function to use a visited set to prevent infinite loops.

